[2].\nDongxu Li, Yanqi Zheng, Xian Tang, “A 47-nA Quiescent Current Dual-Mode Buck Converter With Fast Load Transient Response From Ultra-Light Load Mode”,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems II: Express Briefs (TCAS-II)\n, vol. 1, no. 1, pp. 1-5, 2026.\n[3].\nZ. Zhang, S. Cai, X. Zhang, Xian Tang, “Explainable spatial-temporal-spectral meta-learning for subject-independent EEG-based emotion recognition”,\nExpert Systems with Application\n, vol. 311, 131229, 2026.\n[4].\nShumeng Li, Yang Zhang, Xiao Wang, Xian Tang, and Kong Pang Pun,\n“\nA 77.7 dB-SNDR 625 kHz-BW First-order Noise-Shaping SAR ADC Using a Novel VCO-based Charge-Accumulation Integrator\n”\n,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I: Regular Papers (TCAS-\nI)\n, vol. 72, no. 10, pp. 5338-5350, 2025.\n[5].\nShuqun Ding, Tianqi Xu, Yang Zhang, and Xian Tang, “A 74.3 dB SNDR 3rd-order VCO-Based DSM with built-in Passive Low-Pass Filter in 65nm CMOS”,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems II: Express Briefs (TCAS-II)\n, vol. 72, no. 4, pp. 524-528, 2025.\n[6].\nLiyan Yi, Shanghong Yu, Chaowei Tang, and Xian Tang, “A 10-30 MHz Voltage-Mode Buck Converter with Linear Comparator-Free V2D controller”,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems II: Express Briefs (TCAS-II)\n, vol. 71, no. 7, pp. 3278-3282, Jul. 2024.\n[7].\nYichen Zhang, Chaowei Tang, Yanqi Zheng, Xian Tang, and Ka Nang Leung, “An Adaptive Zero-Current Detector for Single-Inductor Multiple-Output DC–DC Converter with Full-Wave Current Sensor”,\nIEEE Transactions On Very Large Scale Integration(VLSI) Systems (TVLSI)\n, vol. 32, no. 9, pp. 1764-1768, Sept. 2024.\n[8].\nShiying Zhang, Fukun Su, Yi Wang, Songping Mai, Kong Pang Pun, and Xian Tang,\n“\nA Low-power Keyword Spotting System With High-Order Passive Switched-Capacitor Bandpass Filters for Analog-MFCC Feature Extraction\n”\n,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems I\n：\nRegular Papers (TCAS-I)\n, vol. 70, no.11, pp. 4235-4248, 2023.\n[9].\nKan Peng, Xian Tang, Songping Mai, and Zhihua Wang, “A Simultaneous Power and Downlink Data Transfer System with Pulse Phase Modulation”,\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems II: Express Briefs (TCAS-II)\n, vol. 66, no. 5, pp. 808-812, May, 2019.\n[10].\nXian Tang\n,\nJianxu Zeng, Kong Pang Pun, Songping Mai, Chun Zhang, and Zhihua Wang, “Low-cost Maximum Efficiency Tracking Method for Wireless Power Transfer Systems”,\nIEEE Transactions on Power Electronics (TPEL)\n, vol. 33, no. 6, pp. 5317-5329, Jun. 2018.\n代表性著作\n主要专利成果\n其他成果\n荣誉奖项\n2019\n年，清华大学青年教师教学优秀奖\n2019\n年，教育部国家精品在线课程\n2019\n年，教育部在线教育中心智慧教学之星\n2016\n年，清华大学第七届青年教师教学大赛二等奖\n2012\n年，\nIEEE\n固态电路协会\nISSCC Student Travel Grant Award\n常用链接\n关注SIGS\n联系我们\n校区地址：深圳市南山区西丽大学城清华园区\n邮编：518055\n友情链接\n清华首页\n研招网\n校友总会\n清华校历\n校园参观\n宣传资源\n信息公开\n预决算公开\n联系我们\n版权所有@清华大学深圳国际研究生院 京ICP备15006448号 京公网安备 110402430053 号"
