          "fetched_at": "2026-08-01T13:07:13.043961+00:00",
          "title": "张灿阳",
          "text": "张灿阳\n清华大学深圳国际研究生院\n清华化工系\nEN\n导航\n研究院概况\n研究院简介\n院内要闻\n师资队伍\n全职教师（按姓氏拼音...\n博士后\n科学研究\n科研进展\n研究方向简介\n科研平台\n成果与专利\n招生信息\n博士招生\n硕士招生\n港澳台招生\n国际生招生\n招聘信息\n全职教师\n博士后\n其它岗位\n人才培养\n博士研究生\n硕士研究生\n国际联合培养项目\n毕业生之窗\n张灿阳\n发布者：系统管理员\n发布时间：2022-11-24\n浏览次数：\n2154\n助理教授，博士生导师\n学科：化学工程与技术\n联系信息\n电话：\n0755-2640 1402\n邮箱：\nzhang.cy@sz.tsinghua.edu.cn\n地址： 清华大学深圳国际研究院信息楼\n1208\n概况\n张灿阳，清华大学深圳国际研究生院助理教授、博士生导师、特别研究员。\n2014\n年博士毕业于华南理工大学化学工程专业（导师：章莉娟教授、钱宇教授），期间于德国慕尼黑大学联合培养（导师：\nErnst Wagner\n院士），先后于华盛顿州立大学（合作导师：\nZhenjia Wang\n教授）、麻省理工学院（新加坡科研中心，合作导师：\nPaula Hammond\n院士）从事博士后研究。主要从事功能生物医用材料设计与开发，靶向递送与控缓释技术研发，免疫调控，生物医用器件研发，面向肿瘤诊疗、抗菌抗感染、炎症免疫调控等应用的制剂工程研究等。迄今已发表学术论文\n40\n余篇，其中第一\n/\n通讯作者文章\n30\n余篇，包括\nSci. Adv.\n、\nAdv. Mater.\n、\nBiomaterials\n、\nBioact. Mater.\n、\nChem. Eng. J.\n、\nJ. Control. Release\n、\nBiomaterials\n、\nAIChE J.\n等国际高水平期刊，\nH-\n因子\n24\n。\n教育经历\n2009\n年\n09\n月\n-2014\n年\n12\n月，华南理工大学，化学工程专业，博士\n2012\n年\n10\n月\n-2013\n年\n10\n月，慕尼黑大学，药学科技专业，联合培养\n2005\n年\n09\n月\n-2009\n年\n06\n月，西南民族大学，化学工程与工艺专业，学士\n工作经历\n2021\n年\n5\n月\n-\n至今，清华大学深圳国际研究生院，助理教授\n2019\n年\n06\n月\n-2020\n年\n12\n月，麻省理工学院\n-\n新加坡科研中心，博士后\n2016\n年\n08\n月\n-2019\n年\n06\n月，华盛顿州立大学，博士后\n2015\n年\n03\n月\n-2016\n年\n08\n月，国家纳米科学中心，助理研究员\n学术兼职\nPharmaceutics\n、\nInternational Journal of Polymer Science\n杂志客座编辑；\nJournal of Future Foods\n编委\n教学课程\n生物物理化学、实验生物学\n研究领域\n研究方向重点是面向生物医药与生命健康领域重大需求与问题，设计和开发多功能工程化生物材料载体和递送（剂型）策略，用于疾病诊断与治疗，如癌症、感染、自身免疫性疾病。主要有四个研究方向\n:\n1)\n刺激\n-\n响应型（聚\nβ-\n氨基酯）材料库的设计（计算机辅助和模拟）与建立；\n2)\n细胞介导的免疫调控靶向系统的开发；\n3)\n基于产品工程与制剂工程的生物医药与健康工程研究；\n4)\n微针相关技术与产品开发。\n课题组招收博士后、科研助理、博士研究生、以及硕士研究生，欢迎具有化学工程与技术、化学、材料科学与技术、生物学、微生物学、药学、食品工程、医学、生物医学工程等背景的同学加盟。\nWebsite:\nhttps://zhanglab.sigs.tsinghua.edu.cn/\n主要项目\n国家自然科学基金、美国\nNIH\n项目、新加坡\nA*Star\n项目。\n成果：已发表\n37\n篇学术论文，第一\n/\n通讯作者文章\n26\n篇，包括\nScience Advances\n、\nAdvanced Materials\n、\nBiomaterials\n、\nJournal of Controlled Release\n等期刊，申请授权多项发明专利。\n代表性论文\n[1]Yan Wang #, Juan Li#, Jinping Shi, Junyu Liu, Can Yang Zhang*, Graphene-based nanomaterials for cancer therapy and anti-infections, Bioactive Materials. 2022, 14, 335-349.\n[2]Wen Xuan Li, Xiao Peng Zhang, Bo Zhi Chen, Wen Min Fei, Yong Cui*, Can Yang Zhang*, Xin Dong Guo*, An update on microneedle-based systems for diabetes, Drug Delivery and Translational Research. 2022, 1-12.\n[3]Yun Hao Feng, Bo Zhi Chen, Wen Min Fei, Yong Cui, Can Yang Zhang*, Xin Dong Guo*, Mechanism studies on the cellular internalization of nanoparticles using computer simulations: A review, AIChE Journal, 2022, e17507.\n[4]Jinping Shi#, Juan Li#, Yan Wang, Xiaobin Li, Can Yang Zhang*, TiO2-based Nanosystem for Cancer Therapy and Antimicrobial Treatment: A Review. Chemical Engineering Journal. 2021, 431, 133714.\n[5]\n黄龙\n;\n曾文\n;\n徐冰\n;\n张灿阳\n;\n马少华\n;\n张翀\n;\n王怡\n*;\n邢新会\n*,\n口服多糖靶向药物递送体系在结肠疾病治疗中的应用研究进展\n,\n药学学报\n, 2021, 1073.\n[6]Yan Wang,Yuanjun Ma,Jinping Shi,Xianyu Yan,Jun Luo, Huilong Zhu, Kunpeng Jia*, Juan Li*,Can Yang Zhang*, Surface modification of monolayer MoS2 by baking for biomedical application, Frontiers in Chemistry, 2020, 8:741.\n[7]Shuguang Zhang,Peiyao Zhu,Jiayuan He,Siyuan Dong,Peiwen Li,Can Yang Zhang*, Teng Ma*,TME-Responsive Polyprodrug Micelles for Multistage Delivery of Doxorubicin with Improved Cancer Therapeutic Efficacy in Rodents, Advanced Healthcare Materials, 2020, 9(18), 2000387.\n[8]Jinping Shi, Juan Li*, Yan Wang, Jingjing Cheng, Can Yang Zhang*, Recent advances in MoS2-based photothermal therapy for cancer and infectious disease treatment, Journal of Materials Chemistry B, 2020, 8, 5793-5807.\n[9]Can Yang Zhang, Xinyue Dong, Jin Gao, Wenjing Lin, Ze Liu, Zhenjia Wang*, Nanoparticle-induced neutrophil apoptosis increases survival in sepsis and alleviates neurological damage in stroke, Science Advances, 2019, 5(11), eaax7964.\n[10]Can Yang Zhang, Wenjing Lin, Jin Gao, Xutong Shi, Maryam Davaritouchaee, Amy Nielsen, Rock Mancini, Zhenjia Wang*. pH-Responsive Nanoparticles Targeted to Lungs for Improved Therapy of Acute Lung Inflammation/Injury, ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces, 2019, 11(18), 16380-16390.\n[11]Mengzhen Xu#, Can Yang Zhang#, Junguang Wu, Huige Zhou, Ru Bai, Ziyi Shen, Ying Liu*, and Jing Liu*, PEG-Detachable Polymeric Micelles Self-Assembled from Amphiphilic Copolymers for Tumor-Acidity-Triggered Drug Delivery and Controlled Release, ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces, 2019,11(6), 5701-5713.\n[12]Xutong Shi, Can Yang Zhang*, Jin Gao, Zhenjia Wang*, Recent Advances in Photodynamic Therapy for Cancer and Infectious Diseases, Wiley Interdisciplinary Reviews-Nanomedicine and Nanobiotechnology, 2019, e1560.\n[13]Yongle Luo, Xujun Yin, Xi Yin, Anqi Chen, Lili Zhao, Gang Zhang, Wenbo Liao, Xiangxuan Huang*, Juan Li and Can Yang Zhang*, Dual pH/Redox-Responsive Mixed Polymeric Micelles for Anticancer Drug Delivery and Controlled Release, Pharmaceutics, 2019, 11(4), 176.\n[14]Wen Yao Hu, Zhi Min Wu*, Qian Qian Yang, Yue Jin Liu, Juan Li, Can Yang Zhang*, Smart pH-responsive cationic polymeric micelles for programmed oral delivery of insulin, Colloids and Surfaces B: Biointerfaces, 2019, 183:110443-11-453.\n[15]Zhimin Wu*, Manzhen Duan, Di Xiong, Can Yang Zhang*, Mesoscale Simulations of pH-Responsive Polymeric Micelles for Oral Drug Delivery, Pharmaceutics, 2019, 11, 620.\n[16]Can Yang Zhang, Jin Gao, Zhenjia Wang*. Bioresponsive Nanoparticles Targeted to Infectious Microenvironments for Sepsis Management. Advanced Materials, 2018, 30(43), 1803618.\n[17]Juan Li, Yuan Jun Ma, Yan Wang, Bo Zhi Chen, Xin Dong Guo*, Can Yang Zhang*. Dual redox/pH-responsive hybrid polymer-lipid composites: Synthesis, preparation, characterization and application in drug delivery with enhanced therapeutic efficacy. Chemical Engineering Journal, 2018, 341, 450-461.\n[18]Qi Lei Wang, Jia Wei Ren, Bo Zhi Chen, Xuan Jin, Can Yang Zhang*, Xin Dong Guo*. Effect of humidity on mechanical properties of dissolving microneedles for transdermal drug delivery. Journal of Industrial and Engineering Chemistry, 2018, 59, 251-258.\n[19]Xiangxuan Huang, Wenbo Liao, Zhihao Xie, Deshi Chen, Can Yang Zhang*. A pH-responsive prodrug delivery system self-assembled from acid-labile doxorubicin-conjugated amphiphilic pH-sensitive block copolymers. Materials Science & Engineering C-Materials for Biological Applications. 2018, 90, 27-37.\n[20]Can Yang Zhang, Shiyuan Peng, Bin Zhao, Wenji Luo, Lijuan Zhang*. Polymeric micelles self-assembled from amphiphilic polymers with twin disulfides used as siRNA carriers to enhance the transfection. Materials Science & Engineering C-Materials for Biological Applications, 2017, 546-552.\n[21]Can Yang Zhang, Quan Chen, Wen Sheng Wu, Xin Dong Guo, Cheng Zhi Cai, Li Juan Zhang*. Synthesis and evaluation of cholesterol-grafted PEGylated peptides with pH-triggered property as novel drug carriers for cancer chemotherapy. Colloids and Surfaces B: Biointerfaces, 2016, 11 (142): 55-64.\n[22]Can Yang Zhang, Petra Kos, Katharina Müller, Waldemar Schrimpf, Christina Troiber, Ulrich Lächelt, Claudia Scholz, Don C. Lamb, Ernst Wagner*. Native chemical ligation for conversion of sequence-defined oligomers into targeted pDNA and siRNA carriers. Journal of Controlled Release, 2014, 180, 42-50.\n[23]Can Yang Zhang, You Qiang Yang, Tu Xiong Huang, Bin Zhao, Xin Dong Guo, Ju Fang Wang, Li Juan Zhang*. Self-assembled pH-responsive MPEG-b-(PLA-co-PAE) block copolymer micelles for anticancer drug delivery. Biomaterials, 2012, 33, 6273-6283.\nOther relevant publications can be accessed via the following ways\n：\nGoogle scholar link: https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=zh-CN&user=xE1GL4gAAAAJ\nORCID link:\nhttps://orcid.org/0000-0002-6975-5781\n荣誉奖项\n深圳市海外高层次人才，\n2021\n山东省泰山学者，\n2020\n校园地址:深圳市南山区西丽大学城清华园区\n邮编：518055\n研究院概况\n研究院简介\n师资队伍\n全职教师（按...\n博士后\n科学研究\n科研进展\n研究方向简介\n科研平台\n成果与专利\n招生信息\n博士招生\n硕士招生\n港澳台招生\n国际生招生\n招聘信息\n全职教师\n博士后\n其它岗位\n院内要闻\n版权所有@清华大学深圳国际研究生院 京ICP备15006448号\n清华大学\n研招网\n校友会\n信箱\n预决算公开\n纪监信箱\n搜索\n您想要找的"
